// (mirrors services/ask-svc's boot skeleton) with every AccountService RPC
// aborting UNIMPLEMENTED; Tasks 1–4 landed real implementations for
// CreateAccountGroup, ListAccountGroups, ConnectAccount, and ListAccounts in
// queue-svc, so this contract locks the wire shape those four queue-bff
// routes depend on. The remaining AccountService RPCs (GetAccount,
// UpdateAccount, DisconnectAccount, SyncAccounts, RefreshAccount,
// UpdateAccountGroup, DeleteAccountGroup) still abort UNIMPLEMENTED in
// queue-svc, so no Pact interaction exists for them yet — they join this
// file as their handlers land (Task 6+ of this epic, or a follow-on story).
//
